---
/**
 * Dark-only ThemeProvider for LocoLabo sites. The pixel art is a night palette,
 * so the sites commit to one dark theme. Keeps Starlight's provider API so any
 * code calling `StarlightThemeProvider.updatePickers()` still works.
 * Sites that want light/dark back pass `darkOnly: false` to `loco()`.
 */
---

{/* Inlined to avoid a flash of the wrong theme. */}
<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
